<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Contal cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Contal cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analysts Scott Wilkins and Marco Vera have cut their rating for Mexican bottler Grupo Continental SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- They wrote in an April 24 report that first quarter sales fell 3.2 percent in real terms year-over-year, and operating margin rose to 16.1 percent from 14.4 percent in the first quarter of last year.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
